        "date": "2026-11-17T02:39:58Z"
      },
      "message": "fix(post): refuse a default machine file that is not a machine; pin all post paths\n\nReview fixes for PR #2320:\n\n- parse_default_machine refuses an object with no `name` or no\n  `kinematics.static` object. A `{}` file once posted `(CAMCRAFT)` with no\n  M8/M9 words. The shipped 3axis-vmc.mch has both keys.\n- A failed read or a refused default file is no longer kept until\n  restart: the next post reads the file again. A good read is kept.\n- The default machine code moves from posting.rs to the new module\n  posting_default_machine.rs (posting.rs is 1535 lines now; #2322).\n- default_machine_missing pins the per-mount and per-operation refusals\n  (no file written, also none for the mounted setup), the `{}` file, and\n  the parse branches.\n\nFixes #2319\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
